     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {2.29 \\times {{10}^3}} \\right) \\times \\left( {3 \\times {{10}^4}} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: Multiply the number parts.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2.29 \\times 3 = 6.87\"></span>\n</p>\n<p>Step 2: Add the exponents of the 10s.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"3 + 4 = 7\"></span>\n</p>\n<p>Step 3: The result is the answer from Step 1 times 10 raised to the answer from Step 2.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6.87 \\times {10^7}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 4: If the answer is not in scientific notation, adjust it.</p>\n<p>Not necessary.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6.87 \\times {10^7}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"6.87 \\times {10^7}\">6.87 \\times {10^7}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 505793,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"(6.91 \\times {10^{ - 3}}) \\times (9.1 \\times {10^5})\">(6.91 \\times {10^{ - 3}}) \\times (9.1 \\times {10^5})</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {6.91 \\times {{10}^{ - 3}}} \\right) \\times \\left( {9.1 \\times {{10}^5}} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: Multiply the number parts.</p>\n<span data-math=\"6.91 \\times 9.1 = 62.881\"></span>\n<p>Step 2: Add the exponents of the 10s.</p>\n<span data-math=\"-3 + 5 = 2\"></span>\n<p>Step 3: The result is the answer from Step 1 times 10 raised to the answer from Step 2.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"62.881 \\times {10^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 4: If the answer is not in scientific notation, adjust it.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6.2881 \\times {10^3}\"></span></p>"
    },
